          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "业务 HTTP 请求速率（排除 actuator/health/info 内部请求）。来源：Spring Boot 3 Micrometer 默认 http.server.requests 观测 → Prometheus 命名 http_server_requests_seconds_count。",
